  "details": "Affected URL: https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/\n\nA more complete list is found in the API and on the VRChat Wiki:\n\n- https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/config\n\n- https://wiki.vrchat.com/index.php?title=Trusted_URLs&oldid=153249\n\nFor example, several Virtual Market (VKet) and Furality Online Xperience URLs are whitelisted but missing. MidCircuitCDN is also on the whitelist, but not documented. There's a bunch of worlds (CatsUdon, The Mighty Gym) that are on the whitelist too, and several corporate partners from the JP community.",
